<!--How to build - Remove this section before droping the file in the local manifest folder
++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
TO DOWNLOAD THE SOURCE:
repo init --depth=1 -u https://github.com/LineageOS/android.git -b lineage-23.0 --git-lfs
then:
repo sync -c -j$(nproc --all) --force-sync --no-clone-bundle --no-tags

++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++

IF FOR SOME REASONS, IT DOES NOT WORK AS EXPECTED OR YOU DO NOT WANT TO DEAL WITH BUILD ERRORS, USE THIS INSTEAD (revision="refs/tags/android-16.0.0_r1" />):

repo init -u https://github.com/LineageOS/android.git -b 2a46cce5dff3a9a3ab98b3c25a7564084b34cd1f -m default.xml --git-lfs --depth=1
then:
repo sync -c -j$(nproc --all) --force-sync --no-clone-bundle --no-tags

************************************************************
some repos might fail to sync, for example:
++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
GitCommandError: 'fetch --depth=1 --quiet --progress github --force --prune --recurse-submodules=no --no-tags +refs/heads/lineage-21.0:refs/remotes/github/lineage-21.0' on LineageOS/android_cts failed
stdout: fatal: unable to access 'https://github.com/LineageOS/android_cts/': gnutls_handshake() failed: The TLS connection was non-properly terminated. 
++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++

Do this (see https://forum.khadas.com/t/android-13-build-problems/21021/6):

find .repo/ -iname "*android_cts.git"
+++> .repo/project-objects/LineageOS/android_cts.git
rm -rf .repo/project-objects/LineageOS/android_cts.git cts +++> remove that repo
repo sync -j4 cts  +++> manually clone
************************************************************
How to build - Remove this section, create .repo/local_manifests folder and drop in the roomservice.xml file - end./-->

